{"id": "cf71c70d-35d7-4be5-97a7-6697606af54c", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T12:30:05.541557", "source": "user", "parent_id": "b5da2b91-5e75-43d0-8a2e-4136c159f4a1", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{"researcher_request": "项目进入初始审查阶段。请按以下三点提交材料,先不要给出完整的实验方案。审阅通过后我再批准进入主设计阶段。()请检查工作区(/workspace)以及随附的 track.md,确认可用输入、参考材料与已记录的约束条件。若工作区为空或缺少相关源码,请列出你拟依赖的外部资料类型(JaxMARL 文档、SMAX 环境说明、PPO/Q-Learning 在 MARL 中的常见配置等)并明确其作用,不要假定其中细节已确认。(二)请提交一份高层次拟议方案(proposed approach)框架,覆盖以下要素,但每一项只需给出一到两句话的方向性说明,而非最终设计:(1) 研究问题的可操作化拆分;(2) PPO 与 Q-Learning 在 SMAX 中的对照变量与共同变量;(3) 训练时间与归一化得分的度量方式;(4) 对照组与随机种子策略;(5) 可行性与资源/算力约束的初步评估;(6) 拟采用的分析与统计方法。(三)请明确列出由此拟议方案产生的关键假设与不确定性(assumptions and uncertainties),逐条标注是“由文档/上下文支持”还是“由提出者假定”,并按重要性排序。这些将作为我在 approach_review 阶段决定是否批准进入主设计、或要求你先澄清的依据。提交时请严格区分:(a) 你已直接观察到的事实,和(b) 你为推进设计而作出的推断。", "required_handoff_stage": "plan", "approach_approved": false, "public_task": {"question": "How does JaxMARL’s PPO compare to Q-Learning in SMAX environments in terms of training time and normalized score?", "context": "Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.", "environment": {"runtime": "bubblewrap", "network": "disabled", "repository": "/workspace", "python": "python3", "software_environment": "system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled", "datasets": [], "gpu_enabled": false, "cpu_affinity_count": 24, "note": "Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment."}, "researcher_topics": ["neurips2024/97649/0:setup_2", "neurips2024/97649/0:setup_4", "neurips2024/97649/0:setup_12"], "question_budget": 6, "actor_step_budget": 60, "continue_after_initial_plan": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
